        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Melanie Sykes, Vernon Kay\n- TV Shows: Celebrities Under Pressure, The Moment of Truth\n- Topics: hosting chronology, related UK game shows\n\nFacts:\n- Melanie Sykes first hosted \"Celebrities Under Pressure\" for series 1 and 2.\n- Vernon Kay then hosted \"Celebrities Under Pressure\" for series 3.\n- Vernon Kay was associated with this hosting role in 2013–2014.\n- \"Celebrities Under Pressure\" followed two years after \"The Moment of Truth\" ended.\n- \"The Moment of Truth\" and \"Celebrities Under Pressure\" were similar shows.",
